# The score screen: the creatures knocked out stand through their idle once and then die (in their colours, not
# greyed); hero 0 levels up and cheers twice; hero 1, knocked out, stands, kneels and gets no XP ("sem XP"),
# its share going to the heroes standing.
nosave
go 0 0 1
wait 70
xp 0 400
kill 1
wait 40
win
wait 40
key A
wait 20
shot m00-foes-idle
wait 30
shot m01-foes-dying
wait 30
shot m02-coins
wait 25
shot m03-hero0-filling
wait 12
shot m04-hero0-cheer
wait 20
shot m05-hero1-standing
wait 20
shot m06-hero1-kneeling
wait 60
shot m07-end
